@startuml Move Player - Communication Diagram
!theme plain
title **UC-1: Move Player – Communication Diagram**

object ":GameView" as ui #LightBlue
object ":GameController" as ctrl #LightGreen
object ":MoveAction" as ma #LightYellow
object ":MoveEffect" as me #Orange
object ":Hero" as hero #Pink
object ":Map" as map #LightGray
object ":GridCell" as cell #LightGray
object ":GameSession" as sess #White

ui -- ctrl
ctrl -- ma
ctrl -- me
ctrl -- sess
ma -- sess
ma -- hero
ma -- map
ma -- me
map -- cell
me -- hero

ui -> ctrl : 1: moveHero(deltaRow, deltaCol)
ctrl -> ma : 1.1: <<create>> MoveAction(deltaRow, deltaCol)
ctrl -> ma : 1.2: resolve(session)
ma -> sess : 1.2.1: getHero()
ma -> hero : 1.2.2: getRow(), getCol()
ma -> sess : 1.2.3: getMap()
ma -> map  : 1.2.4: getCell(newRow, newCol)
ma -> cell : 1.2.5: isWalkable()
ma -> me   : 1.2.6: <<create>> MoveEffect(hero, newRow, newCol)
ctrl -> me : 1.3: apply(session)
me -> hero : 1.3.1: setPosition(newRow, newCol)
ctrl -> sess : 1.4: advanceTurn()

note bottom of ctrl
  **GRASP Controller**: Handles system event.
  **Creator**: Controller creates MoveAction.
  MoveAction creates MoveEffect (Information Expert –
  it knows target position validity).
end note

@enduml
